{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-07-12 10:00:00', 'title': 'DOW TEAMS UP WITH THE LPGA AND LET AS OFFICIAL SUSTAINABILITY RESOURCE TO ADVANCE ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP AND INCLUSION THROUGH GOLF', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH., JULY 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOW (NYSE: DOW), THE LADIES PROFESSIONAL GOLF ASSOCIATION (LPGA) AND THE LADIES EUROPEAN TOUR (LET) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DOW WILL SERVE AS THE OFFICIAL SUSTAINABILITY RESOURCE FOR THE ORGANIZATIONS.'}